CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774228187
OL,1,Vk4                              G11/20
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGBRITAIN RECOGNISES
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGGEORGIA
OL,4,D
OL,5, Britain has announced that it has
OL,6, decided to recognise the former Soviet
OL,7, republic of Georgia.
OL,9,FThe Prime Minister and the Foreign
OL,10,FSecretary have written to the Georgian
OL,11,Fgovernment offering to establish full
OL,12,Fdiplomatic relations.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FEarlier, the European Community said it
OL,15,Fwould recognise the independence of
OL,16,FGeorgia, the last of the former Soviet
OL,17,Frepublics to seek recognition.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FMeanwhile, the Conference on Security
OL,20,Fand Co-operation in Europe has decided
OL,21,Fto admit Slovenia, Croatia and Georgia.
OL,23,D]FFromG23-03-92F/ teletextarchive.com
